    "body": "## What\r\nEnable `HIPBLASLT_*` environment variables to be passed through in Primus CLI container mode.\r\n\r\n## Why\r\nSome HipBLASLt tuning/config knobs are controlled via `HIPBLASLT_*` env vars.\r\nBefore this change, container mode only forwarded a limited allowlist (e.g. `PRIMUS_`, `NCCL_`, `RCCL_`, `GLOO_`, `IONIC_`), causing container runs to differ from direct-mode behavior and making tuning/debugging harder.\r\n",
    "changed_files": 1,
